			"notes": "🏦Bank System\nA fully-featured bank has been added! Deposit your hard-earned emeralds securely and earn a 1% interest per minute. Use /EMet bankin <amount>, /EMet bankout <amount>, and /EMet bankmoney in-game, or manage your funds through the new Bank tab on both the web interface and in-game GUI. No more worrying about overflowing inventories!\n\n🖥️ In-Game GUI\nSay goodbye to alt-tabbing. Type /EMet browser to open a sleek, full-featured economy panel right inside Minecraft. Market, Auction, Stocks, Bank, and Leaderboard are all accessible with a single click. All data syncs in real-time with the web version, offering a truly immersive experience for your server community.\n\n⚙️ Dynamic Port Switching\nAdmins can now change the web panel port on the fly with /EMet port <port>. No server restart required. Whether you're resolving port conflicts or adjusting network policies, it's never been easier.\n\n💬 Smart Join Message\nEvery player receives a personalized welcome message upon joining, including the market URL and essential command hints. Newcomers can get started immediately without relying on manual guidance.\n\n💎 More Additions\nEmerald Count Command: /EMet emerald shows your current emerald inventory instantly.\n\nBank API: New endpoints /api/bank/balance, /api/bank/deposit, /api/bank/withdraw for developers.\n\nExpanded Stock Market: Now featuring 60 stocks across A-shares and B-shares, with more on the way.\n\n🔧 Fixes & Optimizations\nFixed broadcast IP resolution when starting auctions, now correctly displays local and cloud server addresses.\n\nImproved internal data serialization for better performance under high concurrency.\n\nFully localized web interface in Chinese, with the Bank module seamlessly integrated."
		},
